Earth Siege 2 recomp

The host follows the Sim Theme Park recomp
(https://github.com/sp00nznet/simthemepark-recomp) and runs on pcrecomp's
native32 runtime and module loader (https://github.com/sp00nznet/pcrecomp). All MIT.

